# Build context is the repo root (services/Dockerfile COPYs services/* alongside the root lock
# files), but the image only ever needs `pyproject.toml`, `uv.lock`, and `services/`.
**
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!services
!services/**

# Python cruft that can appear under services/ too, re-excluded after the blanket re-allow above.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
